      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟训练员负责守护她的未来，\n你有义务……事先了解各种案例。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b8cf07b1cbadaaa767ea6e3f95ce6473220dd28cfada58f81d8db9c702874cb",
